  "content": "# 第29题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★★☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n29. As for the public awareness of global collapse, the author is________.\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. worried\n\nB. B. puzzled\n\nC. C. surprised\n\nD. D. scared\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nA\n\n",
  "answer": "B",
  "analysis": "本题考查强调句型。It is/was...that...，强调时间状语yesterday，故选B。"
